@startuml
title Allpatek | Seasonal agreement, evidence and simulated payout
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam dpi 120
hide footbox
actor Merchant
actor Farmer
participant "Angular Webapp" as Web
participant "Spring REST API" as Api
participant "n8n webhook" as N8n

== Agreement ==
Merchant -> Web : Accept the terms for a parcel
Web -> Api : Save merchantSigned on /api/v1/agreements
Farmer -> Web : Accept the merchant-signed request
Web -> Api : PUT /api/v1/agreements/{id} with both flags
alt Save succeeds
  Api -> Api : On newly complete signatures, publish domain event\nand integration event; request parcel in_production
  Api --> Web : Agreement resource
  Web ->> N8n : POST agreement notice
else Save fails after retries
  Web --> Farmer : Show signature error
end

== Milestone ==
Farmer -> Web : Submit a milestone file and notes
Web ->> N8n : POST evidence notice before persistence
Web -> Api : POST /api/v1/evidence with status review
note over Web,Api : A failed save shows an error. The outgoing notice was already attempted.
Merchant -> Web : Verify a submitted milestone
Web -> Api : PUT /api/v1/evidence/{id} with status verified
Merchant -> Web : Approve the simulated release on /escrow
note over Web : A demo card, available balance and verified evidence are required.
Web -> Api : PUT reduced evidence data with status accepted
alt PUT succeeds
  Api --> Web : Updated evidence
else PUT fails
  Web -> Web : Adapter returns its local accepted record as a fallback
end
Web ->> N8n : POST payout notice when UI reports success
note over Web,N8n : The reduced update omits notes and file content.\nThe simulated release does not execute a bank transfer.
@enduml
